  m_Name: unit_710247
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Esteemed Professor Olga (EU)
  unitId: 710247
  unitNumber: 7235
  description: 'Olga is a renowned hunter with an exceptional record. They say she
    took part in and survived the deadliest of missions: Operation Genesis. Due to
    unlikely circumstances, she was the only officer to survive. In reality, the
    person who goes by the name of Olga today hides a shameful secret: she is not
    who she is claiming to be. As a matter of fact, this unknown warrior took on
    the identity of a deceased officer whose face was burned beyond recognition by
    swapping military dog tags. Upon returning from the frontline, she received the
    Siegfried Cross, a military decoration which ensures respect from the whole academy.
    The impersonator is happy with her new life; she believes she can contribute
    a lot more to the academy this way. Subsequently, she managed to join the esteemed
    teaching body thanks to her own skills, but of course her status accelerated
    the process. Having gained the respect of her peers, what could she possibly
    fear for the future?'
  summonDesc: After everything I've been through, I... You! I'll have you peeling
    potatoes!
  fusionDesc: Thank you, Olga... I'll do everything I can to honor your respectable
    name...
